<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
    <meta charset="UTF-8">
    <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
    <meta name="description" content="Mukesh's personal portfolio website">
    <title>Styled Multipage Project</title>

    <style>
        :root {
            --primary: #2563eb;
            --secondary: #1e40af;
            --accent: #10b981;
            --background: #f1f5f9;
            --surface: #ffffff;
            --text: #1e293b;
            --muted: #64748b;
            --spacing: 20px;
            --radius: 12px;
            --shadow: 0 4px 12px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.1);
        }

        * {
            margin: 0;
            padding: 0;
            box-sizing: border-box;
        }

        html {
            scroll-behavior: smooth;
        }

        body {
            font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
            background: var(--background);
            color: var(--text);
            line-height: 1.6;
        }

        header {
            background: var(--primary);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 30px 20px;
        }

        header h1 {
            margin-bottom: 8px;
        }

        nav {
            background: var(--secondary);
            padding: 15px;
            text-align: center;
        }

        nav a {
            color: white;
            text-decoration: none;
            margin: 0 12px;
            font-weight: bold;
        }

        nav a:hover {
            color: #a7f3d0;
        }

        main {
            max-width: 1000px;
            margin: 30px auto;
            padding: 0 20px;
        }

        section {
            background: var(--surface);
            padding: 25px;
            margin-bottom: var(--spacing);
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }

        h2 {
            color: var(--primary);
            margin-bottom: 15px;
        }

        .cards {
            display: grid;
            grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(220px, 1fr));
            gap: var(--spacing);
        }

        .card {
            background: var(--surface);
            padding: 20px;
            border-radius: var(--radius);
            box-shadow: var(--shadow);
        }

        .card h3 {
            color: var(--secondary);
            margin-bottom: 10px;
        }

        .skills {
            display: flex;
            flex-wrap: wrap;
            gap: 10px;
            list-style: none;
        }

        .skills li {
            background: #dbeafe;
            color: var(--secondary);
            padding: 8px 14px;
            border-radius: 20px;
        }

        .button {
            display: inline-block;
            margin-top: 15px;
            background: var(--accent);
            color: white;
            padding: 10px 18px;
            text-decoration: none;
            border-radius: 6px;
        }

        .button:hover {
            background: #059669;
        }

        footer {
            background: var(--secondary);
            color: white;
            text-align: center;
            padding: 20px;
            margin-top: 30px;
        }

        @media (max-width: 600px) {
            header {
                padding: 22px 12px;
            }

            nav a {
                display: inline-block;
                margin: 5px 8px;
            }

            main {
                padding: 0 12px;
            }

            section {
                padding: 18px;
            }
        }
    </style>
</head>

<body>

    <header id="home">
        <h1>Mukesh's Portfolio</h1>
        <p>Explore More, Worry Less</p>
        <p>BCA Student | Aspiring Software Developer</p>
    </header>

    <nav>
        <a href="#home">Home</a>
        <a href="#about">About</a>
        <a href="#skills">Skills</a>
        <a href="#projects">Projects</a>
        <a href="#contact">Contact</a>
    </nav>

    <main>

        <section id="about">
            <h2>About Me</h2>
            <p>
                Hello! My name is Mukesh. I am a BCA student
                interested in programming, web development, and AI.
                I enjoy learning new technologies and solving problems.
            </p>
            <a href="#projects" class="button">View My Projects</a>
        </section>

        <section id="skills">
            <h2>My Technical Skills</h2>
            <ul class="skills">
                <li>HTML</li>
                <li>CSS</li>
                <li>Java</li>
                <li>JavaScript</li>
                <li>Python</li>
                <li>Git & GitHub</li>
            </ul>
        </section>

        <section id="projects">
            <h2>My Projects</h2>

            <div class="cards">
                <article class="card">
                    <h3>Basic Webpage</h3>
                    <p>A simple webpage created using HTML.</p>
                </article>

                <article class="card">
                    <h3>Personal Resume</h3>
                    <p>A resume designed with semantic HTML and CSS.</p>
                </article>

                <article class="card">
                    <h3>College Course Page</h3>
                    <p>A webpage describing my course and subjects.</p>
                </article>
            </div>
        </section>

        <section>
            <h2>My Career Goal</h2>
            <p>
                My goal is to become a skilled software engineer
                and develop useful applications using modern technology.
            </p>
        </section>

        <section id="contact">
            <h2>Contact Me</h2>
            <p>Email: mukesh@example.com</p>
            <p>
                GitHub:
                <a href="https://github.com/" target="_blank"
                   rel="noopener noreferrer">Visit GitHub</a>
            </p>
        </section>

    </main>

    <footer>
        <p>&copy; 2026 Mukesh's Portfolio. All rights reserved.</p>
    </footer>

</body>
</html>